<section class="connections wrap" id="integrations" aria-labelledby="connections-title">
  <div class="connections-heading"><p class="section-label">PART OF YOUR WORKFLOW</p><h2 id="connections-title">Good work happens<br /><em>everywhere.</em></h2><p>Your repositories, your terminal, your everyday shortcuts.<br />Bring the context with you.</p></div>
  <div class="git-feature">
    <div class="git-copy"><span class="connection-index">01 / REPOSITORIES & ISSUES</span><h3>Your code has a home.<br />Now your plans do, too.</h3><p>Connect GitHub or a self-hosted Git provider like Gitea. Bring repository issues into your projects, keep their source context, and plan the work alongside everything else.</p><p class="sync-note">Issues sync into Trestl. Your planning stays in Trestl; changes aren’t posted back to your Git provider.</p><a href="/docs/integrations/github/">Explore Git connections <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="repository-visual" aria-label="GitHub and Gitea issues connected to a Trestl project"><div class="provider-names"><span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"/><path d="M6 7v10M18 8v3a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H6"/></svg>GitHub</span><span>Gitea <span class="self-hosted">self-hosted</span></span></div><div class="repository-path"><span>Repositories & issues</span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><div><img src="/trestl-mark.svg" width="22" height="22" alt=""/><strong>One project. The whole picture.</strong></div></div><div class="connected-issue"><span class="issue-circle" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><strong>Build the interactive product demo</strong><span>demo/studio-web · #42</span></div><span class="provider-tag">GitHub</span></div><div class="connected-issue"><span class="issue-circle" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><strong>Connect our platform repository</strong><span>studio/platform · #18</span></div><span class="provider-tag">Gitea</span></div><span class="visual-caption">Illustrative repositories · real product capabilities</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="workflow-tools">
    <article><span class="connection-index">02 / API</span><h3>Build your own way in.</h3><p>A scoped API with personal access tokens and an OpenAPI contract. Connect your scripts and tools to the same projects and work items.</p><code>GET /api/v1/items</code><a href="/docs/api/">Explore the API <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="connection-index">03 / CLI</span><h3>Stay in your terminal.</h3><p>Search, capture, and update work from any repository. Get structured JSON for scripts, automations, and agent workflows.</p><code>trestl list --status todo --json</code><a href="/docs/integrations/cli/">Meet the CLI <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="connection-index">04 / RAYCAST</span><h3>A thought. A shortcut. Done.</h3><p>Search projects, see your work, create a task, or update its status from Raycast. Capture the thought while it’s still fresh.</p><div class="raycast-command"><span class="raycast-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span>Create Work Item</span><kbd>↵</kbd></div><a href="/docs/integrations/raycast/">Get the Raycast extension <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
  </div>
</section>
